<title>USA: Genesee Corp Q2 Oct 26 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Genesee Corp Q2 Oct 26 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
